      ],
      "messages": {
        "202280000": {
          "id": 202280000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}你好，是我，「旁白」。",
          "next": [
            202280001
          ]
        },
        "202280001": {
          "id": 202280001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "想問問平日你喜歡吃什麼，可以幫我推薦一些嗎？",
          "next": [
            202280002
          ]
        },
        "202280002": {
          "id": 202280002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "最好是價格相對親民的營養食品",
          "next": [
            202280003,
            202280006,
            202280009
          ]
        },
        "202280003": {
          "id": 202280003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "「健康炒米」無煙無油無添加劑，營養但寡淡",
          "next": [
            202280004
          ]
        },
        "202280004": {
          "id": 202280004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "可以試試看貝洛伯格臘腸、仙舟鳥串之類的異地小食，星際快遞隔天就到～",
          "next": [
            202280005
          ]
        },
        "202280005": {
          "id": 202280005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "但聽說要付運費，我會計算一下採購成本，感謝推薦",
          "next": [
            202280011
          ]
        },
        "202280006": {
          "id": 202280006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "很難推薦…我喜歡吃的好像也沒什麼營養",
          "next": [
            202280007
          ]
        },
        "202280007": {
          "id": 202280007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "烤串、亂燉、快樂茶、翅堡、蛋糕……",
          "next": [
            202280008
          ]
        },
        "202280008": {
          "id": 202280008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "相較於那位不死神探的飲食情況，您這也算是某種營養均衡了",
          "next": [
            202280011
          ]
        },
        "202280009": {
          "id": 202280009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我以為你只愛香蕉",
          "next": [
            202280010
          ]
        },
        "202280010": {
          "id": 202280010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "不是我要吃，是不死途先生",
          "next": [
            202280011
          ]
        },
        "202280011": {
          "id": 202280011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "真傷腦筋，最近不死途先生每餐都跟著我吃香蕉，可能是為了省事，或者省錢",
          "next": [
            202280012
          ]
        },
        "202280012": {
          "id": 202280012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "但如果缺少人類需要的複合營養，他的腦袋只會變得更加笨重",
          "next": [
            202280013
          ]
        },
        "202280013": {
          "id": 202280013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "數次忘記帶手機，就是營養不良的臨床表現之一",
          "next": [
            202280014
          ]
        },
        "202280014": {
          "id": 202280014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "所以，我要重新培養他的飲食習慣",
          "next": [
            202280015,
            202280016
          ]
        },
        "202280015": {
          "id": 202280015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "怎麼培養？我也想健康管理！",
          "next": [
            202280018
          ]
        },
        "202280016": {
          "id": 202280016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "多好的保姆型助手啊！",
          "next": [
            202280017
          ]
        },
        "202280017": {
          "id": 202280017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "以他散漫的程度，我得操心這個也是預料之內",
          "next": [
            202280018
          ]
        },
        "202280018": {
          "id": 202280018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "最開始幾天，我把他的香蕉搗成泥，偷偷加入其他水果",
          "next": [
            202280019
          ]
        },
        "202280019": {
          "id": 202280019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "效果不錯，食慾正常、無明顯不滿情緒、無壓力反應",
          "next": [
            202280020
          ]
        },
        "202280020": {
          "id": 202280020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "接下來我打算逐步增加新食物的比例，加入人類喜歡的熱食，漸進混合",
          "next": [
            202280021
          ]
        },
        "202280021": {
          "id": 202280021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "既保護腸胃，也能從味覺上重新喚起他對其他人類食物的興趣",
          "next": [
            202280022
          ]
        },
        "202280022": {
          "id": 202280022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "一個療程最少七天，簡稱「七天換糧法」，非常科學！",
          "next": [
            202280023,
            202280024
          ]
        },
        "202280023": {
          "id": 202280023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "七天換糧法，學到了！",
          "next": [
            202280026
          ]
        },
        "202280024": {
          "id": 202280024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "你倒是比較像他的主人",
          "next": [
            202280025
          ]
        },
        "202280025": {
          "id": 202280025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "我們之間偵探與助手的關係是不會變的",
          "next": [
            202280026
          ]
        },
        "202280026": {
          "id": 202280026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "我看看，昨天是蘋果兩顆、蛋一顆、糯米一碗、蕉一勺、鹽三罐",
          "next": [
            202280027
          ]
        },
        "202280027": {
          "id": 202280027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "噢，這個時間他快回來了，我去準備今天的「蘋果蕉鹽塔」了",
          "next": [
            202280028
          ]
        },
        "202280028": {
          "id": 202280028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "再見",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        1504,
        8001
      ]
    }
  ]
}